      "end_timestamp": "00:42",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:44",
      "end_timestamp": "00:53",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It's mild, honestly. Warm drinks helps a bit. Yes, swallowing. That makes it worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:54",
      "end_timestamp": "01:01",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Does anything else come with it?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:03",
      "end_timestamp": "01:05",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "When it starts I tend to get a mild cough as well. I've been feeling tired too, for five days. About feeling tired, about a six out of ten.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:06",
      "end_timestamp": "01:22",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]",
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Have you had a sore throat before, or is this the first time?",
